{offset150}{arial}Nefertiti Transmission
Message NEF-997
Operator: Corporal Fricks

{offset0}From: {arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}
General Headquarters of Kapharna

 
To: {arialbld}{name}{arial}
Port Vincent

{center}{arialbld}EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY{arial}

As you know, your captain's jeep exploded on a mine this morning, and your captain was sadly inside that jeep...

I've spoken with George Barth, a close friend of mine and the former director of the Military Academy of Kazan, where you were of course promoted to Major. He has informed me you are the best asset we have on site for providing relief as we await reinforcements.

I will not try to hide from you that your situation is a bad one ...

The Psychos control 90% of the country. {arialbld}Port Vincent{arial} is the last base in Jaffari territory which still flies a Normo flag. 

The undefended post of {arialbld}Rabat{arial}, a few leagues to the south-east of Port Vincent, just fell into the hands of Karlo Von Tekton, the youngest of the Tekton brothers (profile below). 


{ia6}{offset100}{arialbld}Karlo Von Tekton{arial}: 27 years old, 3rd son (youngest) of Magnus and Karola Von Tekton, Commander of the Psycho Air Force
Character: Arrogant, impulsive and cruel 
Estimated IQ: 70
Military Education: Fleizig Flying School, mediocre results
Records: Responsible for the loss of seven aircraft during flight training. 5 combat victories of which 2 were over friendly airplanes.{offset0}



Our military psychologists believe that Karlo Von Tekton, intoxicated by his previous success, will come pouncing on you. But we believe that you have a chance of defeating him, because all Karlo has is a handful of self-propelled artillery units, and he hasn't for the moment met with any significant resistance. 


{arialbld}Your mission{arial}: Port Vincent has the necessary resources for production of light tanks (see technical attachment). Organise and bring about production so as to prepare an effective counter-attack.













{center}{device8}












Remember {name} that Port Vincent is our only hope for operating a counter-attack in Jaffar so that the Psychos do not consolidate their gains.

You must also take back the base of Rabat to prevent Karlo from using the land for launching air attacks.  


{offset150}{arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}

Supreme Commander of the Normo Army  



{offset200}{signature1}{offset0}



{}
